bound-lock/1 about="Research status is documentary; source integration only, native capture and admission open." at=witness:042/statements-consumers by=target form=alphabet measure=text needs=src/laws/laws.bound restsOn=law/T87-the-quarter-turn role=writes scope=obligations/theory/review/T87-bounded value="Principal angular separation fixes periodicity of the unit-amplitude identity; the historical raw-angle formula is retained in the evidence fixture. Laminarity and T88/T89 policy/ratio generalizations remain open. F4 domain and objective remain open."
